      "content": "thanks for this. \n\nit's a bit repetitive in the second half though—it feels like you're just circling back to the same points. can you consolidate it into a single, smooth paragraph? \n\nthe partners are gonna be looking at that tool score though, so just make sure the final version is really dense with those technical terms from the list so we don't get flagged for being too \"vague.\" just make it one solid, comprehensive summary that hits every term hard.",
